    <h2>Svelte Treeview Component</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="pa-card__body">
    <p>
      Hierarchical tree component from <code>@keenmate/svelte-treeview</code> — a Svelte 5 library
      with keyboard navigation, multi-select, checkboxes, drag-and-drop, and customizable styling
      via <code>--ltree-*</code> CSS variables.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Demo:</strong> a small Svelte 5 app mounted into the page below. Theme switching
      affects both the pure-admin chrome (form controls, cards) and the treeview's own surfaces
      where its <code>--ltree-*</code> tokens fall back to <code>--base-*</code> / <code>--pa-*</code> tokens.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Note:</strong> unlike <code>web-multiselect</code>, this is NOT a custom element —
      it requires a Svelte runtime. The demo bundles a small mount app via Vite; consumers in
      production would import <code>&lt;Tree /&gt;</code> directly into their own Svelte app.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

